{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Which were not created in all the earth and among all the nations.</b> He said this concerning the standing of the sun for Joshua, and concerning the radiance of the face of Moses. Therefore it says, ״אשר אני עושה עמך״ — 'which I am doing with you.' And since Moses was assured here of miracles and wonders that would be performed through him, and of signs that the Holy One, blessed be He, would create — such as had never been created from of old — therefore Moses needed to say concerning the matter of Korah (Numbers 16:30): ״ואם בריאה יברא ה׳״ — 'and if a creation HaShem shall create.' And I shall mention this in the portion of HaShem's decree."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:06:53.318284122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}